From eb762304f168d5da7adb38740945f148f89a92e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Jackson <70459+jjackson@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:51:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Labs mode: route a request's HQ calls to its worker's HQ
 server (X-Labs-HQ-Host)

Formplayer builds every HQ URL from the one commcarehq.host, so an EU Connect
worker's app download and restore went to www.commcarehq.org and failed. A labs
request may now name its server in X-Labs-HQ-Host, checked against
formplayer.labs.hqHosts (LABS_HQ_HOSTS); LabsHqHostInterceptor rewrites outbound
calls aimed at the configured host to it. No header, no change.
